# sysid_gate.scn.expect — normal-completion check only (G1 state machine + loose
# G3 attitude/actuator bounds through the 3-axis chirp sequence + landed altitude).
# The model-match verdict (forward-model check against the real flip/hover logs) is judged
# by `sf sils sysid-gate` (analysis/datasets/flightlog/forward_check.yaml), NOT here.
# 正常完走のみ（G1状態遷移＋3軸チャープ中の緩いG3境界＋最終着地高度）。モデル一致
# （実機の宙返り・ホバーログに対する順モデル照合）の判定は `sf sils sysid-gate` 側で行う
# （ここでは判定しない）。
#
# Same convention as api_flight.expect (also an API "land" scenario): the
# autonomous descent's ground contact trips the impact detector → "emergency
# DISARM" (state_manager.cpp AlertType::IMPACT path), not the smooth stalled-
# descent "DISARM accepted" text — so this checks "Autonomous landing engaged"
# + a landed-altitude metric instead of a specific disarm log line.
# api_flight.expect（同じく API "land"）と同じ流儀: 自動降下の接地は衝突検出器を
# トリップさせ「emergency DISARM」経路になる（state_manager.cpp の
# AlertType::IMPACT）— 穏やかな失速降下の「DISARM accepted」文言ではないため、
# 特定の disarm ログではなく「Autonomous landing engaged」＋着地高度メトリクスで見る。
exit 0
log_contains any "ARM accepted"
log_contains any "Takeoff complete"
log_contains any "cmd: land"
log_contains any "Autonomous landing engaged"
order "ARM accepted" "Takeoff complete"
order "Takeoff complete" "cmd: land"
order "cmd: land" "Autonomous landing engaged"
# Loose G3 bounds over the hover+chirp window (t=6..40s, before final descent):
# not a fit judgment — just "did not tumble".
# ホバー+チャープ窓(t=6..40s、最終降下前)の緩いG3境界: フィット判定ではなく
# 「転倒していない」だけを見る。
metric tilt_max < 0.6109  in 6.0 40.0  # 35.0 deg
# duty stays healthy through hover + the pre-chirp climb + the roll chirp (no
# saturating differential yet). / ホバー+登坂(chirp前)+ロールchirpはduty健全。
metric duty_max < 0.95  in 6.0 24.0
# pitch/yaw chirp excitation: to keep the differential torque, one of a diagonal motor pair sticks at the duty
# ceiling (1.0) (measured; same mechanism as api_flight's cw90: at the hover duty 0.7245 the differential torque demand is
# pushed to the saturating side). The "up 65" climb margin (to about 1.2 m before the turn/chirp) keeps the craft
# off the ground, so the duty bound is dropped from 24.0 s on (the model-match verdict itself is made by `sf sils sysid-gate`;
# this .expect only checks normal completion, as the header comment says).
# pitch/yaw chirp 励振中は差動トルク維持のため対角モータ対の一方が duty 上限(1.0)に張り付く
# (実測、api_flight の cw90 と同じ機序: ホバー duty=0.7245 では差動トルク要求が飽和側へ押し出される)。
# "up 65" の登坂余裕(旋回/chirp 前に約 1.2 m へ)により地面には届かないため、24.0 s 以降は duty 上限判定を外す
# (モデル一致の判定自体は `sf sils sysid-gate` 側、この .expect は正常完走のみを見る旨は冒頭コメントの通り)。
# Landed and settled by the end of the run. / 実行終了までに着地・整定。
metric alt_max < 0.05  in 40.0 43.9
